{% extends 'layout/frontend.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="container bg-md-guide" id="md-event-app">
        <div class="container-layer" style="background-image: url('/images/fish-background.jpg'); background-size: cover;">
            <img src="/images/md-guild-banner.png" alt="" class="md-guild-banner">
            <h1>Nissan Ambassador Club<br>Port Douglas 2018</h1>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-9 col-sm-12">
                    <p>
                        The highly esteemed Managing Directors Guild welcomed new inductees into the fold at the 2018 event held this year in August at Port Douglas. FY17 High Achievers and their partners were also invited to this amazing event. Accommodation was provided at the luxurious and world-renowned Sheraton Grand Mirage Resort located on the famous 4-mile beach.

                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Just a scenic one-hour drive north from Cairns, Port Douglas shares the same latitude as Tahiti and is justifiably recognized
                        internationally as one of Australia’s best holiday destinations. This sleepy fishing village has been tastefully
                        transformed into the sophisticated yet casual playground of Far North Queensland’s most discerning visitors
                        and now Nissan Managing Director Guild members and Ambassador Club High Achievers.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Port Douglas is renowned for its great range of award-winning restaurants and evening options include the many bars and night-spots.
                        Bask in the warmth on its famous beaches, bathe in the Coral Sea, take a leisurely stroll along tree lined
                        streets bordered with galleries, boutiques & sidewalk cafes. Refresh in pristine waterholes after a rainforest
                        walk or join some of the huge variety of tours & boat charters departing daily. Fishing, diving, sailing,
                        white-water rafting, four-wheel driving, golf, horse-riding and so much more; or simply lounge by the pool
                        sipping a cocktail.
                    </p>
                    <table class="md-guild-table md-guild-table--gold md-guild-table--emphasize-left md-guild-table--full-width">
                        <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th colspan="2">MD GUILD INVITEES</th>
                        </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody data-source="/data/md-guild/guild-current-event-invited.json" id="first-table">
                        {# To modify the contents of this table, use the data file above #}
                        <tr v-for="(row, key, index) in firstTable" :key="index">
                            <td>${ row[0] }</td>
                            <td>${ row[1] }</td>
                        </tr>

                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                    <table class="md-guild-table md-guild-table--platinum md-guild-table--emphasize-left md-guild-table--full-width">
                        <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th colspan="2">HIGH ACHIEVERS 2017</th>
                        </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody data-source="/data/md-guild/guild-current-event-2017-high-achievers.json" id="second-table">
                        {# To modify the contents of this table, use the data file above #}
                        <tr v-for="(row, key, index) in secondTable" :key="index">
                            <td>${ row[0] }</td>
                            <td>${ row[1] }</td>
                        </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-sm-12">
                    <a href="{{ url('/dashboard/MDguild-events-past') }}">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default btn-lg btn-block">Past</button>
                    </a>
                    <a href="{{ url('/dashboard/MDguild') }}">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default btn-lg btn-block">Back</button>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}